
 Usage: chatimport [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...

 ChatImport — local export of Telegram chats to JSONL.

┌─ Options ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ --version                          Version.                                 │
│ --root                      <str>  Output folder for this run (overrides    │
│                                    config and env).                         │
│ --install-completion               Install completion for the current       │
│                                    shell.                                   │
│ --show-completion                  Show completion for the current shell,   │
│                                    to copy it or customize the              │
│                                    installation.                            │
│ --help                             Show this message and exit.              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
┌─ Commands ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ login        First login: phone, code and 2FA password; creates the         │
│              session.                                                       │
│ dialogs      List the groups and channels of the account.                   │
│ trim         Delete the oldest share of the stored history.                 │
│ backfill     Fetch older history than the current floor.                    │
│ check        Check the integrity of the stored files and state.json.        │
│ export-json  Assemble a classic JSON array from the stored parts of one     │
│              chat.                                                          │
│ export-all   Build the combined file of every chat, sorted by time.         │
│ set-root     Change the output folder.                                      │
│ search       Search every stored message (newest first); reads the index,   │
│              works while the service runs.                                  │
│ run          Run the service in this console.                               │
│ window       Run the service with the desktop window (and a tray icon).     │
│ status       Show the service status.                                       │
│ pause        Stop collecting (all chats or one).                            │
│ resume       Continue collecting (all chats or one).                        │
│ recheck      Compare recent days with Telegram now and fix differences.     │
│ chats        Manage the chat library.                                       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

